# Checkpoint 5a — Pass 1/2/3 regression anchor, empty world.
# No /cttwin/scan/... commands at all: defaults are theta = 0, t = 0, and the
# theta = 0 placement path is identical to Pass 3's. Expect 0.99600 total,
